0 FILE 8261 - Rally Truck - Semi-Tractor.ldr
0 Technic semi-tractor rally truck chassis built from liftarms, axles, and cross blocks, integrating a steerable front axle, structural frame submodels, a cabin with grille and curved windshield, and a red rear liftarm assembly with steering wheel.
